  },
  {
   "d": "2022-11-30",
   "doc": "H1 R",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": -2,
   "q": "The impact of lower revenue and increased operating costs in H2 2022/23 are expected to be partially offset by anticipated lower levels of financing costs, achieved from the re-balancing of the proportion of our index-linked debt, which has been undertaken since 30 September.",
   "file": "20221130_PNN_Half-Year-Results-202223.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-03-14",
   "doc": "YE-TU",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "Pennon Group is on track to deliver results in line with management expectations.",
   "file": "20230314_PNN_TRADING-STATEMENT.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-06-01",
   "doc": "FY R",
   "fy": "FY24",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": -1,
   "q": "Overall, these impacts are expected to result in improvements in near-term earnings and, in the longer term, the elevated inflationary environment provides the Group with additional growth in long-term sustainable value, with revenues and RCV linked to November and March outturn inflation, respectively.",
   "file": "20230601_PNN_Full-Year-Results-202223.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-10-02",
   "doc": "H1 TU",
   "fy": "FY24",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": -1,
   "q": "Financial performance for 2023/24 is expected to be weighted into H2, reflecting lower power costs, and the realisation of further efficiencies as we continue to unlock synergies from the integration of Bristol Water and reshape our organisation for K8.",
